NAP1 expression level is controlled by the UPS
We consistently observed a reduction or upper molecular weight smear in NAP1 protein during mitosis across four different cell lines (HeLa, DLD-1, THP1, and RPE-1, and an additional near-diploid cell line), independent of the method of synchronization (
Figs. 1 I
,
2, A and C
,
